---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Filters from '../components/Filters.astro';
import { readings } from '../data/content.json';
const entries=readings;
const topics=[...new Set(entries.map(item=>item.topic))];
---
<Shell title="Why It Was Revealed"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Asbab al-nuzul</span> <h1 class="editorial">{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Read ten Quran passages beside the reports about them. See whether each report names an occasion, gives general context, or shows what happened after.</p></section><div class="evidence-band"><span>A reported occasion</span> <span>General context</span> <span>What happened after</span></div><Filters topics={topics}/><div class="collection-tools"><h2 id="entries">Choose a reading</h2> <button class="button secondary" id="copy-saved">Copy my list</button></div> <div class="card-grid">{entries.map(item=><><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={item.id} data-search={`${item.title} ${item.topic} ${item.reportSummary}`} data-topic={item.topic}><span class="eyebrow">{item.topic}</span> <h2><a data-reading-link={item.id} href={`/reading/${item.id}/`}>{item.title}</a></h2> <p>{item.reportSummary}</p> <span class="micro">{item.passage.ref}</span> <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/reading/${item.id}/`}>Open reading</a> <button class="button secondary" data-save={item.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button></div></article>{' '}</>)}</div> <div id="empty" class="empty" hidden><h2>Nothing matches</h2> <p>Try fewer words, change a filter, or turn off “Saved only.”</p></div><script>import "../lib/library";</script></Shell>